        <mxCell id="http" value="&lt;div style=&quot;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:736px;height:160px;text-align:left;color:#2d3142;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position:absolute;left:16px;top:12px;box-sizing:border-box;border:0.8px solid #bf4520;border-radius:2px;width:256px;height:12px;line-height:10px;padding-left:5px;font-size:8px;font-family:Geist Mono,Courier New,monospace;&quot;&gt;CODE BASELINE + PROPOSED ADMISSION / CONFIG SEAMS&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position:absolute;left:16px;top:32px;font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:16px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;API host · HTTP, CQRS &amp;amp; use cases&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position:absolute;left:16px;top:54px;width:704px;border-top:0.8px solid #bfc0c0;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position:absolute;left:16px;top:58px;font-family:Geist Mono,Courier New,monospace;font-size:9px;line-height:16px;white-space:nowrap;color:#4f5d75;&quot;&gt;CODE: AuthenController → IDispatcher → validator → handler → Result / ProblemDetails&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position:absolute;left:16px;top:74px;font-family:Geist Mono,Courier New,monospace;font-size:9px;line-height:16px;white-space:nowrap;color:#4f5d75;&quot;&gt;CODE: JWT Bearer on /me; domain rules and inner ports; Program.cs composes adapters&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position:absolute;left:16px;top:90px;font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;white-space:nowrap;color:#4f5d75;&quot;&gt;PROPOSED: shared Redis quota checks before commands; public metadata cache through an inner port&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position:absolute;left:16px;top:106px;font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;white-space:nowrap;color:#4f5d75;&quot;&gt;PROPOSED: versioned MongoDB config snapshots and asynchronous event/projection ports&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position:absolute;left:16px;top:122px;font-family:Geist,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:1